{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","name":"JLMS.sharp_factorization_epsilon","type":"∀ {𝕜 : Type u_1} [inst : RCLike 𝕜] {K : Type u_2} [inst_1 : TopologicalSpace K]\n  (T : JLMS.CZero 𝕜 K →L[𝕜] JLMS.CZero 𝕜 K),\n  JLMS.SharpFactorizations T →\n    0 < JLMS.dualEssentialNorm T →\n      ∀ {ε : ℝ},\n        0 < ε →\n          ∃ U V,\n            (U.comp T).comp V = ContinuousLinearMap.id 𝕜 (JLMS.cZero 𝕜) ∧ ‖U‖ * ‖V‖ < 1 / JLMS.dualEssentialNorm T + ε"}
